# ~/.config/git/ignore excludes .claude/ globally (local session state,
# worktrees). This repo ships a real skill + workflow meant to be
# committed and shared with anyone who clones it — un-ignore just those.
!.claude/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/workflows/
!.claude/workflows/**
